      "updated": 1793436510832,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement:\n\n1. Merchant will create payment intent\n2. System will return iframe\n3. Merchant will choose payment method (multiple payment method)\n4. We have to handle idempotency\n5. Exactyle one payment\n6. Store Credential\n\n\nNon-Functional Requiremnts\n1. Consistency & correctness > Availability\n2. It should be scalable\n3. It should also be reliable\n4. No duplcate payments",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement:\n\n1. Merchant will create payment intent\n2. System will return iframe\n3. Merchant will choose payment method (multiple payment method)\n4. We have to handle idempotency\n5. Exactyle one payment\n6. Store Credential\n\n\nNon-Functional Requiremnts\n1. Consistency & correctness > Availability\n2. It should be scalable\n3. It should also be reliable\n4. No duplcate payments",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
