      "text": "Core Entities/Apis\n\nPayment service\nPayment orchestrator\nNotification service\nAnalytic service\nAudit Service\nLogging Service\nWebhook handler\nReconciliation worker\n\nAPIS:\n\nPOST: Payment intent\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Entities/Apis\n\nPayment service\nPayment orchestrator\nNotification service\nAnalytic service\nAudit Service\nLogging Service\nWebhook handler\nReconciliation worker\n\nAPIS:\n\nPOST: Payment intent\n",
